The exporter uses the public libctru AM and filesystem interfaces.
Installed-title SMDH archive access, language fallback and region handling were
informed by FBI's MIT-licensed implementation.

FBI-NH was used as a known-working reference for CIA ExHeader/RSF packaging.
See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for third-party projects, URLs and usage details.

No FBI, FBI-NH, bannertool or makerom binary is included in the released 3DSX
or CIA application. Build-time tools are retrieved by GitHub Actions.
